        The Attacker Moves Second: Stronger Adaptive Attacks Bypass Defenses Against Llm Jailbreaks and Prompt Injections
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nasr%2C+M">Milad Nasr</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Carlini%2C+N">Nicholas Carlini</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sitawarin%2C+C">Chawin Sitawarin</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Schulhoff%2C+S+V">Sander V. Schulhoff</a>, 
      
