        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span>-Assisted and Human-Guided: Perceptions and Practices of Software Professionals Using LLMs for Coding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Santos%2C+I">Italo Santos</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Magalhaes%2C+C">Cleyton Magalhaes</a>, 
      
