    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Goal-oriented Backdoor Attack against Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-Action <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> via Physical Objects
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
